{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top-down arcade shooter where each wave forces a choice: lure more enemies to gather more meat and unlock upgrades, or reduce the danger but risk being too weak against the final boss at the end of eight waves. Challenging arcade gameplay for experienced players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on approaching enemies with your binoculars: the longer you wait, the greater the threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/extras/6a281f5a0a25385882d3b00c58ecf49a.poster.avif?t=1761124519\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/extras/6a281f5a0a25385882d3b00c58ecf49a.webm?t=1761124519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/extras/6a281f5a0a25385882d3b00c58ecf49a.mp4?t=1761124519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of enemies with unique traits to collect meat while protecting your life and the colony gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/extras/b81dd4a064ea2c7ad0153d456cf56425.poster.avif?t=1761124519\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/extras/b81dd4a064ea2c7ad0153d456cf56425.webm?t=1761124519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/extras/b81dd4a064ea2c7ad0153d456cf56425.mp4?t=1761124519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear and weapons using the meat you collect (spread shot, rapid fire, dash, shield, healing drone, anti-slip boots, etc.). Some upgrades help counter specific enemy traits, making weapon choices strategic depending on the number and type of enemies you face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/extras/8584a5aaee0ca26144e5b801d8bfe668.poster.avif?t=1761124519\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/extras/8584a5aaee0ca26144e5b801d8bfe668.webm?t=1761124519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/extras/8584a5aaee0ca26144e5b801d8bfe668.mp4?t=1761124519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072180?t=1761124519","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072180?t=1761124519","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/ea8fbb660849f9573f83d548fbbc8e6a5a69b5ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761124519","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072180/ea8fbb660849f9573f83d548fbbc8e6a5a69b5ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761124519","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top-down arcade shooter where e